---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Resume | Justin Hoffmann" showNav>
  <section class="resume">
    <h1>Resume</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      IT Technician supporting Microsoft 365, Windows, networking, and
      firewalls across multi-tenant MSP client environments. Outside work I run
      a Proxmox and OPNsense home lab — VLAN segmentation, containerized
      services, and an 18-script PowerShell toolkit.
    </p>

    <a
      class="download-btn"
      href="/Justin_Hoffmann_Resume_Aug2026.pdf"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      ⬇ Download Resume
    </a>

    <h2>Professional Experience</h2>

    <div class="job">
      <h3>Business Information Solutions</h3>
      <p class="job-title">IT Technician | March 2026 – Present</p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Provide remote and onsite support for business clients, administering
          Microsoft 365, Entra ID, Exchange Online, and Active Directory.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built cross-platform PowerShell and CUPS scripts to automate network
          printer diagnostics across Windows and macOS fleets.
        </li>
        <li>
          Executed a SonicWall firewall LAN zone migration with zero downtime by
          pre-staging config and verifying cabling before cutover.
        </li>
        <li>
          Manage endpoint lifecycle across client tenants, verifying Entra join
          status via Intune for secure provisioning and decommissioning.
        </li>
        <li>
          Diagnosed hybrid M365 mobile authentication failures through Entra ID
          sign-in log analysis.
        </li>
        <li>
          Investigate EDR-flagged files in Huntress and SentinelOne, separating
          legitimate antivirus driver artifacts from genuine threats.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="job">
      <h3>Harris Business Machines</h3>
      <p class="job-title">
        Service / Network Technician | September 2022 – February 2026
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Configured TCP/IP, DHCP, SMB file sharing, and printer connectivity.
        </li>
        <li>Diagnosed hardware, firmware, software, and networking issues.</li>
        <li>Performed remote support using TeamViewer.</li>
        <li>
          Installed, repaired, and maintained office technology while minimizing
          downtime.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="job">
      <h3>Metric</h3>
      <p class="job-title">Field Technician | October 2018 – September 2022</p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Provided field technical support and served as help desk contact,
          troubleshooting hardware, software, and connectivity remotely and
          on-site.
        </li>
        <li>
          Set up, configured, and repaired laptops, mobile devices, and field
          equipment.
        </li>
        <li>
          Managed user accounts, password resets, and access permissions across
          field systems.
        </li>
        <li>
          Improved communication and operational efficiency across multiple
          projects.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Technical Skills</h2>

    <div class="skills">
      <span>Microsoft 365</span>
      <span>Microsoft Entra ID</span>
      <span>Active Directory</span>
      <span>Exchange Online</span>
      <span>Windows 10/11</span>
      <span>Windows Server</span>
      <span>Linux</span>
      <span>macOS</span>
      <span>PowerShell</span>
      <span>Proxmox VE</span>
      <span>Docker</span>
      <span>Virtual Machines</span>
      <span>TCP/IP</span>
      <span>DHCP</span>
      <span>DNS</span>
      <span>SMB</span>
      <span>VPN</span>
      <span>SonicWall / SonicOS</span>
      <span>CUPS</span>
      <span>NinjaOne</span>
      <span>Intune</span>
      <span>SentinelOne</span>
      <span>Huntress</span>
      <span>Guardz</span>
      <span>Barracuda</span>
      <span>Printer Administration</span>
    </div>

    <div class="cta">
      <h2>Projects</h2>

      <p>
        Want to see these technologies in action? Explore my home lab and
        technical projects where I document the solutions I've built and the
        skills I've developed.
      </p>

      <a href="/projects" class="projects-button"> View My Projects → </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .resume {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;

    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 80px auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .resume h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .resume h2 {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .download-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    background: var(--accent-dark);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .download-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent-darker);
  }

  .job {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .job h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .job-title {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .job ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .job li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .skills span {
    background: var(--surface-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }

  .projects-button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-dark);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .projects-button:hover {
    background: var(--accent-dark);
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .resume {
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
